    <guid isPermaLink="false">660f0528c891c06e7357e8b9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Apr 2024 19:53:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi, 大家好呀。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天这期是清明节特辑，所以我们要聊一聊应景的，进击的巨人！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的主播Hzio临时缺席一期，因为她要去给艾伦扫墓（不要抢三笠的活啊Hzio！</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是！久违的jimmie又回归惹！热烈欢迎！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在接下来的内容里你将会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:00:53</a>: 巨人终于完结啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">00:02:46</a>: 对结局满意吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">00:07:46</a>: 现实与漫画</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">00:12:18</a>: 有关始祖尤弥尔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">00:20:30</a>: 谏山创，或许，可以不用写感情线的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">00:25:50</a>: 最搞笑的地方是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">00:31:04</a>: 可能的未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2077">00:34:37</a>: 吃妈巨人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">00:40:17</a>: 艾伦是不是反社会人格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">00:42:42</a>: 关于兵长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2947">00:49:07</a>: 最感动的地方是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3904">01:05:04</a>: 最难过的地方是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【封面图】</span></p><span></span><p><span>三小只——艾伦耶格尔-Rumbling</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Survival 金红石</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Ciryous 鹰仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Jimmie</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>僕の戦争 —— 神聖かまってちゃん</span></p><span></span><p><span>悪魔の子 —— ヒグチアイ</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑： 鹰仔</span></p>]]></description>
