    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fb55f12d9eae5d0a0c87b8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Mar 2024 21:32:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>书接上回, &nbsp;废话不多说, 请听!</span></p><span></span><p><span>【封面图】</span></p><span></span><p><span>铁塔实拍——HZIO</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Ciryous 鹰仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ HZIO HZIO</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Survival 金红石</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Chlo_S6e8 克洛伊</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:00:34</a> 都是懒狗罢了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">00:03:26</a> 真是一场惊险的挂科冒险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">00:06:03</a> 夏令营=?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">00:08:08</a> 堕胎法入刑法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">00:12:52</a> 卡琳娜仲尼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">00:18:17</a> 🇸🇬的taylor演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">00:20:49</a> 🇸🇬没啥好玩的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">00:23:11</a> NUS也不咋地（除了商学院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">00:26:37</a> 但是烂不过🇫🇷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">00:30:10</a> 🇫🇷行政速度像那个蜗牛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1974">00:32:54</a> 在法国，一生收不到一个快递</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">00:35:07</a> 生日礼物，直接发红包！靴靴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2154">00:35:54</a> 金红石帮jimmie给鹰仔买的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2271">00:37:51</a> 真是让人摸不着脑袋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2507">00:41:47</a> 跟家里人多久联系一次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3134">00:52:14</a> 夸夸新加坡and法国</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Come and Get Your Love —— Redbone</span></p><span></span><p><span>Walk Like An Egyptian —— The Bangles</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑： 鹰仔</span></p>]]></description>
