  <item>
    <title>Ep4： 🇸🇬🇫🇷坡县法村大PK（学习篇）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f22cd3696bd9a8790a241a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f22cd3696bd9a8790a241a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 22:46:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>由于一些快乐的原因（放假）和一些悲伤的原因（考试），第四期姗姗来迟惹，但是！这期厉害了，我们请来了在世界排名第8（划重点）的新加坡国立大学读研的克洛伊，aka隔壁的隔壁宿舍的舍友，来给我们讲讲在坡县的求学＋生活故事，顺便也吐槽吐槽我们在法村的经历。</span></p><p><span>由于我们太能唠，只能把全部内容分为上下学习+生活两期放送，那我们开始吧始吧~</span></p><p><span>【封面图】</span></p><p><span>NUS美照——克洛伊</span></p><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>@ Ciryous 鹰仔</span></p><p><span>@ HZIO HZIO</span></p><p><span>@ Survival 金红石</span></p><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><p><span>@ Chlo_S6e8 克洛伊</span></p><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">00:02:04</a> 学习制度，法国工程师vs新加坡课程型硕士</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">00:06:02</a> 新加坡只适合旅游？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">00:06:59</a> 一些dirty talk</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">00:10:28</a> 所以说猪真的会吔屎吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">00:11:46</a> 内蒙的高速公路旱厕</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">00:14:05</a> 坡县小吐槽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">00:15:35</a> 上课压力大不大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">00:22:46</a> 反向出国了属于是</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1421">00:23:41</a> 说中文的，只有学妹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">00:25:07</a> 赏心悦目赏心悦目</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">00:30:32</a> 实验室的牛马实习生活</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2087">00:34:47</a> 金红石沉迷最终幻想</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2284">00:38:04</a> 巴黎专用包</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2423">00:40:23</a> 老师和同学咋样</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2807">00:46:47</a> 老师在课上当堂唱rap（不是</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">00:48:51</a> 似曾相识的法国老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3074">00:51:14</a> 所谓互帮互助</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3210">00:53:30</a> 关于迟到</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3367">00:56:07</a> 好找工作不，读博方便吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3777">01:02:57</a> 新加坡法国房价</span></p><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><p><span>Sisyphus —— Andrew Bird</span></p><p><span>Sweet Home Alabama —— Lynyrd Skynyrd&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>剪辑： 鹰仔</span></p>]]></description>
