  <item>
    <title>Ep3: 爱，婚姻和垃圾人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d6973735dd8780ed0f05c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d6973735dd8780ed0f05c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Feb 2024 00:37:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年的新年跟情人节大重合，作为新年的第一期以及情人节特辑，我们刚好也一起聊聊有关爱情的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们邀请到了重磅嘉宾，寝室里神秘的第四人，jimmie!</span></p><span></span><p><span>掌声在哪里！热情在哪里! 八卦又在哪里！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【封面图】</span></p><span></span><p><span>毕业照</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Survival 金红石</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ HZIO HZIO</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Ciryous 鹰仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Jimmie</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">00:04:34</a>: Jimmie的玄学恋爱小故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1043">00:17:23</a>: 旅游时突然病倒，是扔掉ta还是陪伴ta</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">00:26:31</a>: 理想型？外貌？性格？(180-请跳过这一段）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2088">00:34:48</a>: 好看的皮囊千篇一律，丑陋的皮囊千奇百怪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2967">00:49:27</a>: 那些年我们缺失的性教育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3393">00:56:33</a>: 不是不生，是调生，等退休了一定生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3972">01:06:12</a>: 亲，这边的建议是去巴基斯坦呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4664">01:17:44</a>:《代号鸢》+ 《进击的巨人》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4972">01:22:52</a>: 最讨厌的男性特质？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5750">01:35:50</a>: 近期的日常闲聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>只爱陌生人（live) —— 王菲</span></p><span></span><p><span>花（木吉他版）—— 花儿乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑： 鹰仔</span></p>]]></description>
