  <item>
    <title>Ep2：什么时候能轮到我暴富？聊聊那些年关于玄学的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65bc41db0bef6c2074848769</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65bc41db0bef6c2074848769</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Feb 2024 01:14:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！本期我们试图开展关于玄学的大讨论，到底什么时候能暴富？什么时候能脱单？西方东方玄学到底哪个靠谱？</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及按照惯例歪楼唠唠别的神奇小故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢AI提供的，客观的真实的有据可依的内容提要~</span></p><span></span><p><span>C’est parti!</span></p><span></span><p><span>【封面图】</span></p><span></span><p><span>巴塞罗那某教堂——HZIO供图</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ HZIO HZIO</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Survival 金红石</span></p><span></span><p><span>@ Ciryous 鹰仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">00:01:30</a>:单身现象：为什么同龄人结婚生子变得如此遥远？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">00:06:04</a>:信仰与幸福：一个家庭的神秘供奉之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">00:12:31</a>:伦敦生活下的悲痛与寻找——一个女孩在教堂中的思考与感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">00:18:01</a>:“爱情占卜视频揭秘：肌肉健壮的桃花迹象！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">00:23:25</a>:拯救爱人的壮举：医学生路见不得的震撼故事！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2226">00:37:06</a>:通灵师的神秘力量：揭开猫咪背后的心灵沟通之谜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2378">00:39:38</a>:一位俄语教师的奇怪发音：挑战法语学习者的听力理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3126">00:52:06</a>:“笑翻！致命公司背后的搞笑故事，你绝对不能错过！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3526">00:58:46</a>:男童体内惊奇之旅：吃土、长蛆、出现小丑脸！你敢相信吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3885">01:04:45</a>:美味的玉米诱惑：口感醇香，令人回味无穷！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4321">01:12:01</a>:染发的痛苦与困惑：年轻人的发型选择困境</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cell Block Tango——from Chicago</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑： 鹰仔</span></p>]]></description>
